README:340 [DIFF] run
   README: Run Maestro flows against a simulator or emulator. No visual regression: reports step pass/fail and captures a screenshot on failure (see --keep-alive, --logs, --flow)
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:341 [DIFF] record
   README: Record a simulator or emulator and extract PNG frames at exact requested timestamps
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:342 [DIFF] hierarchy
   README: Dump the UI hierarchy of a booted simulator or emulator without relaunching the app (reads a `run --keep-alive` session)
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:343 [DIFF] build build
   README: Build the app for a simulator (xcodebuild) or emulator (Gradle); `grantiva build` alone runs this
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:344 [DIFF] build install
   README: Build and install the app on a simulator or emulator, then optionally launch it (--no-launch to skip)
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:345 [DIFF] ci run
   README: Run full CI pipeline: capture screenshots, compare against baselines, upload results
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:346 [DIFF] diff capture
   README: Navigate to configured screens and capture screenshots
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:347 [DIFF] diff compare
   README: Diff current captures against baselines
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:348 [DIFF] diff approve
   README: Promote current captures to baselines
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:349 [DIFF] simulator ensure
   README: Create or reuse a named simulator and boot it (--name alone reuses an existing one)
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:350 [DIFF] simulator delete
   README: Explicitly delete a named simulator
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
351 UNPARSED grantiva simulator sessions List Grantiva-managed simulator capacity slots
352 UNPARSED grantiva simulator teardown End a managed session, or reclaim one simulator by UDID when no ledger entry exists (--udid <UDID> --force)
README:353 [DIFF] simulator cleanup
   README: Delete Grantiva-created simulators that are shut down and not part of an active session
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:354 [DIFF] emulator ensure
   README: Create the AVD when missing (installing its system image first) and boot it; stdout is the serial, or with --no-boot the AVD name (the serial when it is already running)
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:355 [DIFF] emulator delete
   README: Delete an AVD Grantiva created; others need --force; a running AVD is never deleted
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:356 [DIFF] emulator sessions
   README: List the emulators Grantiva started
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:357 [DIFF] emulator teardown
   README: Kill emulators Grantiva started: one by --serial, or --all
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:358 [DIFF] console
   README: Manage your Grantiva dashboard from the terminal (see `grantiva console --help`)
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:359 [DIFF] auth login
   README: Authenticate with Grantiva API
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:360 [DIFF] auth status
   README: Show current authentication status
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:361 [DIFF] auth logout
   README: Remove saved authentication credentials
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:362 [DIFF] doctor
   README: Check environment and dependencies (non-zero exit if a required check fails)
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:363 [DIFF] runner install
   README: Extract or update the embedded runner binary
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:364 [DIFF] runner version
   README: Show the embedded runner version
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:365 [DIFF] runner start
   README: Start the runner with WDA (UIAutomator2 on Android) and keep it alive for interactive use
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:366 [DIFF] runner stop
   README: Stop the running runner session
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:367 [DIFF] runner dump-hierarchy
   README: Dump the view hierarchy from a running app for agent inspection
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:368 [DIFF] mcp
   README: Start the Grantiva MCP server for AI agent integration (tool list: docs/mcp.md)
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
README:369 [DIFF] init
   README: Generate grantiva.yml (iOS) or grantiva-android.yml (Android) in the current directory
   help:   NO HELP PAGE
